  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"es\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"><font color=\"#000000\">(11 fotos) Seis establecimientos de cinco de los quince municipios que componen la Mancomunidad Espad&aacute;n Mijares participan en las I Jornadas Gastron&oacute;micas, organizadas por la entidad y sucesoras de las rutas de la tapa que se celebraron en las cuatro ediciones anteriores.</font></span></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7006.jpg\" alt=\"img_7006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7009.jpg\" alt=\"img_7009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7011.jpg\" alt=\"img_7011\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7013.jpg\" alt=\"img_7013\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7015.jpg\" alt=\"img_7015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7016.jpg\" alt=\"img_7016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7018.jpg\" alt=\"img_7018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/jornadesgastronomiquesmancomunitat/img_7020.jpg\" alt=\"img_7020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25